---
import ContentPage from '../components/ContentPage.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import { siteImages } from '../data/images';

const faqItems = [
  { question: 'Why is a Karinderya code not accepted?', answer: 'Check the spelling, capitalization, and any extra spaces. A code may also have changed or may already have been used on the account.' },
  { question: 'Can Karinderya codes change?', answer: 'Yes. Code availability may change over time, so check current game information before trying a code.' },
  { question: 'Where should I look for code-related updates?', answer: 'Use the Updates section of this Wiki to review pages connected with changes to the game.' },
];
---

<ContentPage
  title="Karinderya Codes Guide"
  description="Learn how the Karinderya code system works, how to enter codes, and what to check when a code is not accepted."
  kicker="Code help"
  intro="Use this guide to understand the Karinderya code system and the basic steps for entering a code."
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner-guide/' },
    { label: 'Updates', href: '/updates/' },
    { label: 'Guides', href: '/guides/' },
  ]}
  tableOfContents
  heroImage={siteImages.codesHero}
>
  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>Codes are text strings entered through the game's code interface. Their availability may change over time, so this page focuses on using the system rather than maintaining a permanent list.</p>

  <h2 id="how-codes-work">How Codes Work</h2>
  <p>A code must be entered in the form currently recognized by the game. Spelling, capitalization, account history, and changes to the game can affect whether an entry is accepted.</p>

  <h2 id="how-to-use-codes">How to Use Codes</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Karinderya and locate the current code interface.</li>
    <li>Enter the code exactly as shown in current game information.</li>
    <li>Remove spaces before or after the text.</li>
    <li>Submit the entry once and read the message displayed by the game.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Check every character and match capitalization.</li>
    <li>Make sure no extra spaces were included.</li>
    <li>Consider whether the account has already used the same code.</li>
    <li>Check current game information because code availability can change.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="gameplay-tips">Gameplay Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Enter codes carefully instead of submitting several variations quickly.</li>
    <li>Read the in-game response before trying the same entry again.</li>
    <li>Use the Updates section to continue exploring game changes and Wiki coverage.</li>
  </ul>

  <FAQ items={faqItems} />
</ContentPage>
